        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>问题解决 - 分数乘法应用</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    background: #f2eee6;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdfcf9;\n    padding: 25px 30px 15px 30px;\n    position: relative;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n  .header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .header .diamonds {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #7a5aa8;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    transform: rotate(15deg);\n  }\n  .header .title {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #333;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #7a5aa8;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .circle-num {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f2a13c;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .q-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .q-row .q-main {\n    flex: 1 1 180px;\n  }\n  .q-row .q-arrow1 {\n    flex: 0 0 150px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .q-row .q-arrow2 {\n    flex: 0 0 130px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .arrow-red {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 3px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #eef0e6;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #777;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .scene {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 165px;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n    position: relative;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg,#dfe9dc 0%,#c9dbcb 40%, #9fbf95 70%, #7fae7c 100%);\n    border: 1px solid #aaa;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .scene .cap {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 4px;\n    right: 6px;\n    color: #555;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n  }\n  .scene .label1 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 12px;\n    left: 8px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #888;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .scene .label2 {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 55px;\n    left: 12px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n  }\n  .scene .label3 {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 20px;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n  }\n  .bubble-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .bubble {\n    flex: 1;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    background: #fbfbf5;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .kid {\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 34px;\n    flex: 0 0 28px;\n    background: #f4dfc0;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #999;\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .bar-diagram {\n    margin: 10px auto;\n    width: 280px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n  }\n  .bar {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 26px;\n    border: 1px solid #444;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .bar .seg {\n    flex: 1;\n    border-right: 1px solid #444;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .bar .seg:last-child { border-right: none; }\n  .bar .shaded { background: #f6d38a; }\n  .calc {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 20px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .answer {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n  }\n  .note-italic {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n    font-style: normal;\n  }\n  hr.sep {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    margin: 16px 0;\n  }\n  .grid-diagram {\n    width: 260px;\n    margin: 6px auto 4px auto;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .grid-label-top {\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .grid-box {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 240px;\n    height: 130px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border: 1px solid #444;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to right,\n      #fff 0px, #fff 30px, #f5f5f5 30px, #f5f5f5 60px\n    );\n  }\n  .grid-box .overlay-34 {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0; top: 0;\n    width: 75%;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      45deg,\n      rgba(200,60,60,0.15) 0px,\n      rgba(200,60,60,0.15) 4px,\n      transparent 4px,\n      transparent 8px\n    );\n    border-right: 2px solid #c0392b;\n  }\n  .grid-box .overlay-35 {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0; top: 0;\n    width: 45%;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      -45deg,\n      rgba(150,40,40,0.35) 0px,\n      rgba(150,40,40,0.35) 3px,\n      transparent 3px,\n      transparent 7px\n    );\n  }\n  .grid-side-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -70px;\n    top: 40%;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    width: 65px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .grid-under-label {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .attention-box {\n    background: #eef2f5;\n    border: 1px solid #b9c6cf;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .page-footer {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .panda-ph {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 20px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    background: #eee;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #888;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 20px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <span class=\"diamonds\">◆◇</span><span class=\"title\">问题解决</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Question 1 -->\n  <div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-main\"><span class=\"circle-num\">1</span>汽车已经行了多多千米？</div>\n    <div class=\"q-arrow1\">求一个数的几分之几的问题</div>\n    <div class=\"q-arrow2\"><span class=\"arrow-red\">➤</span>用已知量乘分率</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scene\">\n    <div class=\"label1\">\"行了全程的<span>2</span><sub></sub>3\"</div>\n    <div class=\"label2\">要行84千米</div>\n    <div class=\"label3\">已经行了全程的 2/3</div>\n    <div class=\"cap\">[图：山间公路，客车行驶中]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bubble-row\">\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <div class=\"kid\">[人物]</div>\n      <div>怎么理解\"已经行了全程的2/3\"?</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <div class=\"kid\">[人物]</div>\n      <div>就是把全程看作单位\"1\"，已经行的路程是84km的2/3</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <div class=\"kid\">[人物]</div>\n      <div>把全程平均分成3份，已经行了2份</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bar-diagram\">\n    行了全程的 2/3\n    <div class=\"bar\">\n      <div class=\"seg shaded\"></div>\n      <div class=\"seg shaded\"></div>\n      <div class=\"seg\"></div>\n    </div>\n    全程84km\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    可以这样算：84÷3×2＝56（km）<br>\n    也可以这样算：84×$\\dfrac{2}{3}$ ＝ $\\dfrac{84\\times2}{3}$ ＝56（km）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"answer\">答：汽车已经行了56km。当分数用来表示单位\"1\"的几分之几时，也可以叫做\"分率\"。</div>\n  <div class=\"answer\" style=\"margin-left:20px;\">单位\"1\"×几分之几＝几分之几对应的量</div>\n\n  <div class=\"note-italic\"><strong>议一议</strong> \"84×2/3\"这样列式，你是怎么想的？</div>\n\n  <hr class=\"sep\">\n\n  <!-- Question 2 -->\n  <div class=\"q-row\">\n    <div class=\"q-main\"><span class=\"circle-num\">2</span>张伯伯把20hm²土地的3/4用来种玫瑰，其中种红玫瑰的面积占玫瑰地的3/5。张伯伯种了多少公顷红玫瑰。</div>\n    <div class=\"q-arrow1\">连续求一个数的几分之几的问题</div>\n    <div class=\"q-arrow2\"><span class=\"arrow-red\">➤</span>用已知量连续乘分率</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid-diagram\">\n    <div class=\"grid-label-top\">20hm²土地</div>\n    <div class=\"grid-box\">\n      <div class=\"overlay-34\"></div>\n      <div class=\"overlay-35\"></div>\n      <div class=\"grid-side-label\">20hm²土地的3/4种玫瑰</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-under-label\">玫瑰地的3/5种红玫瑰</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bubble-row\">\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <div class=\"kid\">[人物]</div>\n      <div>题中的3/4表示什么意思？3/5呢？</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <div class=\"kid\">[人物]</div>\n      <div>3/4表示把20hm²土地看作单位\"1\"，其中的3/4种玫瑰</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bubble-row\">\n    <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"flex:2;\">\n      <div class=\"kid\">[人物]</div>\n      <div>3/5表示把种玫瑰的土地看作单位\"1\"，其中的3/5种红玫瑰。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div class=\"kid\">[人物]</div>\n      <div>还可以怎样解决？</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"calc\">\n    20×$\\dfrac{3}{4}$×$\\dfrac{3}{5}$ ＝9（hm²）　种红玫瑰\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"answer\">答：张伯伯种了9hm²红玫瑰。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"attention-box\">\n    <strong>注意：</strong>分数连乘题中蕴含基本的数量关系式：单位\"1\"的量×分率＝分率的对应量。准确地找出单位\"1\"，理解题目中\"哪个量是（或占、相当于）哪个量的几分之几\"，是哪个量的几分之几，那个量就是单位\"1\"。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-footer\">\n    <span class=\"panda-ph\">[熊猫]</span>&nbsp;7\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
